# Per-user Claude Code state lives under .claude/ — `.claude/skills/` + `.claude/settings.json` are tracked
# (project conventions). Each collaborator maintains their own `.claude/.gitignore` locally to filter out
# their own session/worktree/state noise. Suggested patterns: sessions/, worktrees/, settings.local.json,
# plugin-*.local.md, .* (with .gitignore listed under .* so the file ignores itself).
